\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Oh Lord God Jehovah,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Majestic is Thy Name;
\par Herald around the earth.
\par Thou who hast covered the entire
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Universe with all Thy glory.
\par Jehovah, Thou art our Lord,
\par And our great God,
\par Almighty is Thy Name.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  When I look at Thy hands;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And the works of Thy heav'ns,
\par The moon and all the stars,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 All the things Thou has established.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Who at all is a human being?
\par Whom Thou art mindful of him?
\par Which human being,
\par remember all your deeds.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. You've crowned him with glory,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Lower than the angels.
\par You've crowned him with glory,
\par Around his head as his headgear;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Dominion over all Thy works.
\par You have given him honour, Exceedingly.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Jehovah grants them all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. All the sheep and oxen,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj And wild beasts in the field,
\par You've placed under his feet.
\par Birds of the air, fish of the sea,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj That pass through the paths of the seas.
\par Oh Lord, our Lord, Our Lord God,
\par You are mighty.
\par Felt all over the earth.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

